# 🧪 Semester 5 Projects

This folder contains all projects completed during **Semester 5** of my studies at **Universiti Teknikal Malaysia Melaka (UTeM)**,  
Faculty of Electronic and Computer Engineering Technology (FTKEK).

---

## 🚌 [Bus Ticket Management System (Website)](./Bus_Ticket_Management_System)
A web-based bus ticket booking and management system developed using **InfinityFree** as the main hosting platform and database service.  
This system allows users to manage bus schedules, ticket bookings, and basic passenger information through a simple web interface.

---

## 🚦 [Smart Traffic Light System (IoT)](./Smart_Traffic_Light_System)
An intelligent traffic light control and monitoring system integrated with IoT technology.  
**Node-RED** is used as the main monitoring dashboard to visualize traffic light status and system conditions in real time.

---

## 🛢️ [HMI Project – Oil & Gas Process Monitoring (InTouch)](./HMI_Oil_and_Gas_Project)
An industrial Human Machine Interface (HMI) project developed using **InTouch (Wonderware)** software, divided into two main parts:

- **Process Monitoring System** – Real-time monitoring and visualization of oil & gas industrial process parameters.  
- **PFD to P&ID Conversion** – Conversion of Process Flow Diagram (PFD) into Piping & Instrumentation Diagram (P&ID) using InTouch.

---

### 🧰 Tools & Software
- InfinityFree (Web Hosting & Database)  
